{"seq":2,"slug":"original-item-return-or-abandon","title":"补发后原品回收/弃置处置（联126）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-fraud-recovery/original-item-return-or-abandon","wordCount":1963,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"补发后原品回收-弃置处置-联126\">补发后原品回收/弃置处置（联126）</h1><p>补发之后，那件原来的商品有几种命运。丢件场景下它可能永远不出现；错发场景下买家手里有一件他不想要的商品；漏发场景下根本没有原品可回收；破损场景下买家手里有一件残品。这些情形共同制造了一个普遍的工程问题：<strong>系统里有一批货，既不在可售库存里，也不在任何人的手上，而且没有明确的出口</strong>。它们通常以「在途库存」或「待处理」的名义长期挂账，最后在一次盘点中被发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-原品的四种终局\">核心概念：原品的四种终局</h2><p>把原品的处置穷举清楚是第一步。四种终局覆盖了几乎所有情形，剩下的是它们的组合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>终局</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>是否需要买家配合</th>\n<th>库存去向</th>\n<th>账务处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收回入仓</td>\n<td>逆向物流到达且质检通过</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>可售/翻新库存</td>\n<td>无损失或仅包装成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收回待处置</td>\n<td>到达但质检不通过</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>残次/报废</td>\n<td>损失或折价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弃置给买家</td>\n<td>货值低于逆向运费，买家保留</td>\n<td>否（通知即可）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全额商品损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放弃追回</td>\n<td>在途超期确认丢失</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全额商品损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行「弃置给买家」是一个常被忽略但极其实用的选项。当逆向运费高于货值时，让买家保留商品是成本最低的选择，而且不需要买家做任何动作。但它有前提：<strong>必须明确通知买家商品归其所有且不再收费</strong>，否则会产生一个尴尬的后果——买家可能认为这仍是卖家的东西而保存着等待取回，然后某天发起「我买了东西但你们没退钱」的争议。</p>\n<p>美国法律对这一点有一个明确的规则：邮递的<strong>未订购商品</strong>，收件人「可以将其视为礼物，有权保留、使用、丢弃或处置」，且寄件人不得就该商品向收件人开具账单或发送催款通知（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/39/3009\">39 U.S.C. § 3009</a>）。这个规则针对的是「未经订购」的商品，而补发件在多数情况下不构成未订购商品（因为它是对原订单的履约），因此<strong>不能默认适用</strong>。但它提示了一个重要事实：如果同一件商品被重复寄出，多寄出的那一件在实务上很可能被认定为未订购商品，寄件人不得就它收费。这条推论正是重复补发防控的一个法律侧面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[补发已发出] --&gt; B{原品当前在哪}&#10;  B --&gt;|在买家手上| C{货值 vs 逆向运费}&#10;  C --&gt;|逆向运费 &gt; 货值| D[弃置给买家&lt;br/&gt;发归属通知]&#10;  C --&gt;|货值更高| E[发起逆向回收]&#10;  B --&gt;|在途未到| F{是否超期}&#10;  F --&gt;|未超期| G[保持追踪]&#10;  F --&gt;|超期确认丢失| H[放弃追回]&#10;  B --&gt;|根本未发出| I[无原品&lt;br/&gt;直接关单]&#10;  E --&gt; J{质检结果}&#10;  J --&gt;|通过| K[回补可售/翻新]&#10;  J --&gt;|不通过| L[残次/报废]&#10;  D --&gt; M[关单&lt;br/&gt;全额商品损失]&#10;  H --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  A[补发已发出] --&gt; B{原品当前在哪}\n  B --&gt;|在买家手上| C{货值 vs 逆向运费}\n  C --&gt;|逆向运费 &gt; 货值| D[弃置给买家&lt;br/&gt;发归属通知]\n  C --&gt;|货值更高| E[发起逆向回收]\n  B --&gt;|在途未到| F{是否超期}\n  F --&gt;|未超期| G[保持追踪]\n  F --&gt;|超期确认丢失| H[放弃追回]\n  B --&gt;|根本未发出| I[无原品&lt;br/&gt;直接关单]\n  E --&gt; J{质检结果}\n  J --&gt;|通过| K[回补可售/翻新]\n  J --&gt;|不通过| L[残次/报废]\n  D --&gt; M[关单&lt;br/&gt;全额商品损失]\n  H --&gt; M</pre><h2 id=\"弃置决策的量化判据\">弃置决策的量化判据</h2><p>弃置与回收之间有一条明确的分界线：<strong>回收的净收益是否为正</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>net_recover</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>pass</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reverse</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>inspect</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>relist</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net\\_recover} = V_{\\text{resale}} \\cdot r_{\\text{pass}} - C_{\\text{reverse}} - C_{\\text{inspect}} - C_{\\text{relist}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9251em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net_recover</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reverse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inspect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">relist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{resale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重新上架后的预期售价（不是原售价，因为回收件的定价通常要打折），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>pass</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{pass}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是质检通过率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reverse</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{reverse}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reverse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是逆向运费与操作成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>inspect</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{inspect}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inspect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是质检成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>relist</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{relist}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">relist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重新上架成本（可能包括清洁、换包装）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>net_recover</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net\\_recover} \\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.946em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net_recover</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，弃置是更优选择。</p>\n<p>这个不等式里最容易取错的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>pass</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{pass}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。它是<strong>按品类</strong>的，而不是全局的。电子产品的质检通过率通常很低（经历过一次国际往返运输），而标准化程度高的商品（比如书籍、耗材）通过率较高。用一个全局通过率会让决策在两端都出错：对电子产品过度乐观（回收后发现大部分报废），对可回收品类过度悲观（把还能卖的货弃置）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类特征</th>\n<th>典型通过率</th>\n<th>回收经济性</th>\n<th>建议默认</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化、无电子件</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>默认回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含电子件、精密</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>默认弃置或折价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>易碎、体积大</td>\n<td>低且逆向运费高</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>默认弃置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高值、非易碎</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>默认回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低值轻小</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>取决于逆向运费</td>\n<td>按运费判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def recommend_disposition(item, policy):&#10;    rev_cost = policy.reverse_shipping(item)&#10;    if rev_cost &gt; item.goods_value:&#10;        return &quot;ABANDON_TO_BUYER&quot;&#10;    pass_rate = policy.qc_pass_rate(item.category)&#10;    expected = item.resale_value * pass_rate&#10;    costs = rev_cost + policy.inspection_cost(item) + policy.relist_cost(item)&#10;    if expected - costs &lt;= 0:&#10;        return &quot;ABANDON_TO_BUYER&quot; if item.buyer_holds else &quot;WRITE_OFF_IN_TRANSIT&quot;&#10;    return &quot;RETURN_TO_STOCK&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recommend_disposition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item, policy):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rev_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy.reverse_shipping(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rev_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.goods_value:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ABANDON_TO_BUYER\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pass_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy.qc_pass_rate(item.category)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.resale_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pass_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    costs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rev_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy.inspection_cost(item) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy.relist_cost(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> costs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ABANDON_TO_BUYER\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.buyer_holds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"WRITE_OFF_IN_TRANSIT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"RETURN_TO_STOCK\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第一行的提前返回值得注意：<strong>当逆向运费本身已经超过货值时，不需要再算通过率</strong>。这是一个纯粹的占优判断，把它放在最前面能避免计算，也能避免通过率模型的不确定性影响一个本来就不需要它的决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态对象与超期兜底\">状态对象与超期兜底</h2><p>原品处置需要一个独立的状态对象，挂在补发请求上。它的关键设计是<strong>必须有超期兜底</strong>——任何「等待中」的状态都必须有到期时间与自动出口。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE original_item_disposition (&#10;  disposition_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  request_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL UNIQUE&#10;                  REFERENCES reship_request(request_id),&#10;&#10;  disposition     TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (disposition IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;RETURN_TO_STOCK&#39;,&#10;                                         &#39;RETURN_FOR_SCRAP&#39;,&#39;ABANDON_TO_BUYER&#39;,&#10;                                         &#39;WRITE_OFF_IN_TRANSIT&#39;,&#39;NO_ITEM&#39;)),&#10;  buyer_notified  BOOLEAN     NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;&#10;  reverse_shipment_id BIGINT  REFERENCES shipment(shipment_id),&#10;  qc_result       TEXT        CHECK (qc_result IN&#10;                    (&#39;PASS_AS_NEW&#39;,&#39;PASS_REPACK&#39;,&#39;REFURBISH&#39;,&#39;DAMAGED&#39;,&#39;SCRAP&#39;)),&#10;&#10;  decided_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  resolve_by      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  resolved_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;&#10;  CONSTRAINT decision_is_final CHECK (&#10;    disposition = &#39;PENDING&#39; OR resolve_by IS NOT NULL&#10;  ),&#10;  CONSTRAINT abandon_requires_notice CHECK (&#10;    disposition &lt;&gt; &#39;ABANDON_TO_BUYER&#39; OR buyer_notified = TRUE&#10;  ),&#10;  CONSTRAINT qc_only_for_return CHECK (&#10;    qc_result IS NULL OR disposition IN (&#39;RETURN_TO_STOCK&#39;,&#39;RETURN_FOR_SCRAP&#39;)&#10;  )&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> original_item_disposition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disposition_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reship_request(request_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disposition     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (disposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RETURN_TO_STOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                                         'RETURN_FOR_SCRAP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ABANDON_TO_BUYER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                                         'WRITE_OFF_IN_TRANSIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NO_ITEM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buyer_notified  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reverse_shipment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment(shipment_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qc_result       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qc_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PASS_AS_NEW'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PASS_REPACK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFURBISH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DAMAGED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SCRAP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolve_by      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolved_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision_is_final </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    disposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resolve_by </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> abandon_requires_notice </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    disposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ABANDON_TO_BUYER'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buyer_notified </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qc_only_for_return </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RETURN_TO_STOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RETURN_FOR_SCRAP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条约束各有明确目标。<code>decision_is_final</code> 要求任何非 PENDING 的处置都必须带一个到期日——这正是「超期兜底」的强制形式。<code>abandon_requires_notice</code> 把「弃置必须通知买家」写成硬约束，杜绝了前面说的那个尴尬后果。<code>qc_only_for_return</code> 防止出现「没有回收却填了质检结果」这种不一致记录。</p>\n<p>配合一个定期扫描，把超期的 PENDING 记录推向终局：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE original_item_disposition d&#10;SET    disposition = CASE&#10;         WHEN d.reverse_shipment_id IS NULL&#10;              AND d.buyer_notified&#10;              AND d.decided_at &lt; now() - INTERVAL &#39;60 days&#39;&#10;           THEN &#39;WRITE_OFF_IN_TRANSIT&#39;&#10;         ELSE d.disposition&#10;       END,&#10;       resolved_at = now()&#10;WHERE  d.disposition = &#39;PENDING&#39;&#10;  AND  d.resolve_by &lt; now();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> original_item_disposition d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    disposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reverse_shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_notified</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'WRITE_OFF_IN_TRANSIT'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">disposition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       resolved_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">disposition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">resolve_by</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里把「无逆向单 + 已通知买家 + 超过 60 天」映射为在途损失的核销。60 天这个数值应当是可配置的，它取决于线路的最长在途时间——用一个过短的期限会把还在正常运输中的包裹误核销，用一个过长的期限则失去了兜底的意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"残品的折价路径\">残品的折价路径</h2><p>质检不通过的原品不应直接报废，因为「质检不通过」是一个宽泛的判定，包含从「仅包装破损」到「功能损坏」的整个区间。把它们全部计入全额损失，会让残品处置这条通道的价值被低估。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质检结论</th>\n<th>处置路径</th>\n<th>库存科目</th>\n<th>计价方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PASS_AS_NEW</td>\n<td>回补可售</td>\n<td>可售库存</td>\n<td>原价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PASS_REPACK</td>\n<td>换包装后回补</td>\n<td>可售库存</td>\n<td>原价 + 包装成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REFURBISH</td>\n<td>翻新流程</td>\n<td>翻新库存</td>\n<td>原价折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAMAGED</td>\n<td>残次品渠道</td>\n<td>残次品库存</td>\n<td>折价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SCRAP</td>\n<td>报废</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全额损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>DAMAGED</code> 这一档的存在有一个直接的经济意义：它把「还能卖一点钱」的货从全额损失里救回来。残次品渠道的售价可能只有原价的两三成，但对于单价较高的商品，这个差额可观。它的工程要求是库存系统必须能表达一个有独立定价规则的库存科目，而不是只有「可售 / 不可售」两个状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>原品有<strong>四种终局</strong>：收回入仓、收回待处置、弃置给买家、放弃追回。弃置是一个常被忽略但成本最低的选项。</li>\n<li>弃置决策用净回收收益判据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>net</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>pass</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reverse</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>inspect</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>relist</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net} = V_{\\text{resale}} \\cdot r_{\\text{pass}} - C_{\\text{reverse}} - C_{\\text{inspect}} - C_{\\text{relist}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reverse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inspect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">relist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；逆向运费超过货值时<strong>提前判定占优</strong>，不必计算通过率。</li>\n<li>质检通过率必须<strong>按品类</strong>取值，全局通过率会让决策在电子产品与标准化商品两端同时出错。</li>\n<li>处置状态必须有<strong>超期兜底</strong>（<code>resolve_by</code> + 定期扫描），否则未回收的原品会永久挂在待处理状态。</li>\n<li><strong>弃置必须显式通知买家商品归其所有</strong>，否则买家会保存等待取回并可能发起争议；未订购商品不得计费的规则（39 U.S.C. § 3009）提示了这条边界的存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与其他篇的边界\">与其他篇的边界</h2><p>本篇只讲补发之后原品的去向。原品的存在与状态由事实判定决定，见 <a href=\"../reship-decision-scenario/missing-short-wrong-damaged-lost\">漏发/少件/错发/破损/丢失判定</a>；质检分档与库存回补的语义见 <a href=\"../exchange-transaction-inventory/exchange-inventory-hold-availability\">换货库存预留与可得性</a>；回收与弃置的成本如何计入指标见 <a href=\"reship-cost-sla-service-metric\">补发成本/SLA/一次解决率度量</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"补发后原品回收/弃置处置（联126）","id":"补发后原品回收-弃置处置-联126"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：原品的四种终局","id":"核心概念-原品的四种终局"},{"level":2,"text":"弃置决策的量化判据","id":"弃置决策的量化判据"},{"level":2,"text":"状态对象与超期兜底","id":"状态对象与超期兜底"},{"level":2,"text":"残品的折价路径","id":"残品的折价路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他篇的边界","id":"与其他篇的边界"}],"prev":{"title":"虚假未收到/重复补发薅羊毛防控（联036）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-fraud-recovery/false-nondelivery-reship-abuse"},"next":{"title":"补发成本/SLA/一次解决率度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-fraud-recovery/reship-cost-sla-service-metric"}}